When you hit a solid surface, this spell tears down the laws of probability to make you instantly appear on the other side.

Teleports up to [13, 17, 20, 23, 25 (TL1-5; SP 100)] grids.

After a successful probability travel you are left unstable, unable to do it again for a number of turns equal to [400%, 350%, 300%, 250%, 200% (TL1-5)] of the number of tiles you blinked through.

The range will improve with your Spellpower.
